{"t":"Porgol's Strange Behaviour (Book)","s":"porgol-s-strange-behaviour-book-4bf2a","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Stamped_Letter_e97275.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Dear Muriel!</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Stamped Letter\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stamped_Letter_e97275.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains of Havoc</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Arcian is concerned about the behaviour of his assistant Porgol.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Arcian</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Muriel\">Muriel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Well%20of%20Life\">Well of Life</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Pits of Inferno</a>, Laira, Porgol</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Plains of Havoc Library.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This book has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>Dear Muriel!<br/>My apprentice behaves strangely lately.<br/>I fear he has something evil in mind.<br/>He must have stolen the books about<br/>necromancy you were missing after<br/>our last visit but I have no proof yet.<br/>Thank the gods he does not know about<br/>the fountain of life and the caves of<br/>inferno yet. I will send Laira to town in<br/>some days. I think she's in danger <br/>if I'm right about Porgol.<br/><br/>Your friend,<br/>Arcian</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["iron-helmet-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"iron-helmet-quest","quest":"Iron Helmet Quest","step":"0-2","n":3,"title":"Abrir o corpo","kind":"reward","coords":[]}]}}